Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:53.42,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:41.01,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:44.06,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:50.93,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:55.44,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:21:00.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.91,0:21:05.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:10.49,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:15.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:20.72,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:26.20,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice reaches forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:31.14,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:36.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:41.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:46.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:46.52,Caption Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscy90\pos(764,515)\frx0\fry8\blur0.5}Kawachi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:32.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What was {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:45.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was just about to get up...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:51.66,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:55.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:59.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll meet to bargain with them early next week, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:11.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My grandfather died last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:15.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That dream I had...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:19.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:30.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seems he'd lost touch with the family...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:56.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I come back after all this time and it's for a funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:30.25,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh, Daikichi, you got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:32.50,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Just put your bags in Grandpa's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:33.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}By the way, there was a girl in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is Haruko's girl already that old?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.67,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't Reina...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then whose kid is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:50.19,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it! This kitchen is so inconvenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.32,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:02.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he was already 79 and died peacefully, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:06.16,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, that girl is Grandpa's illegitimate child...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:07.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:10.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's {\i1}child{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.88,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa didn't say a thing about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.25,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,And his lover took off, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:20.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,His {\i1}lover{\i0}?! He was {\i1}79{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:23.96,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's so embarrassing, not to mention shameful...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:27.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like your little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:30.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And my {\i1}aunt{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.56,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,How can you joke about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:37.07,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're 30 years old! You should know when it's the right time to joke around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:05.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You died in peace, huh, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:28.70,Default,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I put in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.37,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,As much as you like. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.96,Default,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but there's a standard, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:38.37,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, any amount is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:40.88,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Although these days, it's very common for sutras to be recited
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:44.34,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,and a posthumous Buddhist name to be given...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.43,Default,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,She said 400,000 to 500,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.81,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a {\i1}lot{\i0}  of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.27,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:00.15,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:02.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, busy enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:07.02,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,You always say you're busy! Too busy to even visit your own mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:09.62,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even come home for New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:15.33,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop running! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:20.58,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:22.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.17,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dai! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:25.17,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.55,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:28.97,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.39,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Now be a good girl and don't run around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No way! I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:35.27,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:42.94,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,You look a lot like your grandfather when he was younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:52.33,Default,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.33,0:07:53.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, from mom earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.45,Default,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.74,Default,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure my elder brother was lonely living alone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:03.09,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, there's a maternity health record book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:04.83,Default,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,It says her name is Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:08.80,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevertheless, we're talking about a 79-year-old man...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:13.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, besides  what your father would or wouldn't have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:15.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I still think it's pretty impressive....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:19.22,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, would you bring the cushions out of the closet for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.26,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.07,0:09:13.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:15.78,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's swap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:17.99,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.87,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it like it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:25.96,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:34.46,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:36.80,Default,Sayuri,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, how clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Is it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:42.10,Default,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,It certainly is! You're very good at cat's cradle, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:47.23,Default,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Next, try to make a four-square ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.90,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:53.11,Default,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my, Reina... Here, let me show you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:53.82,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:55.57,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Poop bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.99,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it this instant, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle, Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can go to sleep first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take my turn watching the incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:54.51,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,I-If you insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:58.38,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:03.15,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get some rest over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.02,Default,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.56,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi says he'll watch over it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:09.73,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oof...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.15,Default,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of my big brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:22.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You get some sleep too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that mug...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.86,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,All right, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:58.45,Default,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Please make your final farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:06.12,Default,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.00,Default,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Big brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:07.75,Default,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.96,Default,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:15.11,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come along, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:16.42,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.01,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to say goodbye to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.39,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.81,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,A field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.27,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:38.03,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm making a field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:40.70,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You come over here and say goodbye as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Place these on Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.38,Default,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,Bellflower...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa loved that flower...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:10.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That flower makes Grandpa happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:16.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not going to wake up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:26.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No. He's not going to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:41.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really are his daughter, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:03.90,Default,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this Yoshii Masako go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:07.65,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think any good will come from finding someone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.91,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,who can abandon her child and run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.45,Default,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,How utterly irresponsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:17.41,Default,Yoshiharu,0000,0000,0000,,My big brother was stubborn about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:39.85,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That girl can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:41.19,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Annoying, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.23,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,And she still has all of her baby teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.28,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,She can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:52.32,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's why it's so {\i1}boring{\i0} being with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.45,0:16:57.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here! You can have all these if you go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:00.37,Default,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a candy man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:03.12,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:05.92,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,The most important thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.92,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,who's going to take care of that child {\i1}right now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.00,Default,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:12.47,Default,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Not while I have the store to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:16.18,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe if she were a little better behaved...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.98,Default,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,And she doesn't like to talk either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:19.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:24.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're at home all the time. Why don't you take her in for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.98,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You know that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:30.36,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have that much free time on my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:34.82,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand how hard it is to raise a child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:39.31,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't I made enough sacrifices over the years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:41.33,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd feel sorry for the girl if she came over
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:42.66,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,and no one had the time to look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:48.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't this meeting supposed to be about who {\i1}would{\i0} take in Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:53.05,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you're going to do anything anyway, right brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:55.26,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Think about this more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:18:01.18,Default,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not even certain that she {\i1}is{\i0} Grandpa's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:05.73,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,See? You haven't thought it through so you can't even give me a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:44.68,Default,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I say we try placing her in a facility as quickly as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.36,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:05.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.23,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.10,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Old man, I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Old man...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:26.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,After all, {\i1}you're{\i0} my aunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:10.93,Default,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,More?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.93,0:22:12.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:14.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All we have left is rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make a rice ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything to put in the rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:22.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:28.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! That's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:29.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:34.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll have a tender taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:37.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.12,0:22:40.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I mean Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:42.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi is strange too...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:49.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
